flowchart LR
  Client[Web / Mobile Clients] --> CDN[CDN + WAF]
  CDN --> LB[API Gateway / Load Balancer]
  LB --> API[Spring Boot API Replicas]
  LB --> Voice[Realtime Voice Gateway]
  Voice --> STT[Streaming Speech-to-Text]
  Voice --> TTS[Streaming Text-to-Speech]
  API --> Queue[Event Queue]
  API --> DB[(PostgreSQL)]
  API --> Cache[(Redis)]
  API --> Vector[(Vector Store / pgvector)]
  Queue --> Workers[Background Workers]
  Workers --> CRM[CRM / Booking / Summaries]
  Workers --> Analytics[Analytics Pipeline]
  API --> Monitor[Metrics / Logs / Tracing]
  Workers --> Monitor
